    "category": "Currency",
    "description": "100 sp = 1 gp. 10,000 cp = 1 gp. The currency of property, enchanted gear, mercenary contracts, and high-rank bounties. Gold appears at rank A+ among merchants and nobles. Most adventurers rarely see gold.",
    "bonuses": []
